{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46839","headline":"湘中寓居春日感怀 · 齐己","name":"湘中寓居春日感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江禽野兽两堪伤，避射惊弹各自忙。\n头角任多无獬豸，羽毛虽衆让鸳鸯。\n落苔红小樱桃熟，侵井青纤燕麦长。\n吟把离骚忆前事，汨罗春浪撼残阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}